    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "How many ways can the letters in the word NONSENSE be arranged?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$1680$",
      "worked": "There are 8 letters, with 3 Ns, 2 Ss and 2 Es.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\frac{8!}{3!2!2!}\\\\N&=1680\\end{align*}$$",
